+| 18    | Cerebellum (lateral) | left       | -25.5  | -60.9  | -35.1  |
++-------+----------------------+------------+--------+--------+--------+
+| 19    | Cerebellum (lateral) | right      | 28.4   | -60.9  | -37.1  |
++-------+----------------------+------------+--------+--------+--------+
+| 20    | Anterior Cingulate   | midline    | 1.8    | 34.9   | 13.7   |
++-------+----------------------+------------+--------+--------+--------+
+| 21    | Middle Cingulate     | midline    | 1.0    | -18.0  | 36.5   |
++-------+----------------------+------------+--------+--------+--------+
+| 22    | Thalamus             | midline    | 0.5    | -18.8  | 6.8    |
